==== ReplaceInSecondHand ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the model that will be used to replace the second hand item with a specific animation.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ReplaceInSecondHand = Bag_PistolCase_LHand holdingbagleft,
</syntaxhighlight>
